A -----------------+ half- +-------------- SUM
    |  +-------+   | adder |   ____    |
B -----+ half- +---+       +---\   \   |
    |  | adder |   +-------+    >or >----- Cout
C -----+       +---------------/___/   |
    |  +-------+                       |
    +----------------------------------+
@end example
@end quotation
